# Click "Send request" above any request (Visual Studio 2022 17.8+ / VS Code REST Client).
# Start BOTH projects first: Employee360.MockApi (5100) and Employee360.Integration (5200).

@integration = http://localhost:5200
@mock = http://localhost:5100

### 1. Publish the whole scenario sequence (samples/events/*.json)
POST {{integration}}/samples/publish

### 2. Overall status: queue depth, events by status, open dead letters
GET {{integration}}/health

### 3. What happened to the first event? (Succeeded; duplicatesIgnored counts the redelivery)
GET {{integration}}/events/EVT-10452-001

### 4. The older event that arrived after a newer one (Superseded)
GET {{integration}}/events/EVT-10452-002

### 5. Everything the integration knows about one employee
GET {{integration}}/employees/EMP10452

### 6. What actually reached Employee 360 (duplicates and stale events never did)
GET {{mock}}/admin/stats

### 7. Failed events, with payload, stage and reason
GET {{integration}}/deadletters

### 8. Replay a failed event: paste an id from the request above
POST {{integration}}/deadletters/9b063092-6f1c-4f8e-8591-7896d0c59efe/replay

### 9. Send the same event again by hand (idempotency demo)
POST {{integration}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "EVT-10452-001",
  "eventType": "EmployeeUpdated",
  "employeeId": "EMP10452",
  "firstName": "Amira",
  "lastName": "Khan",
  "department": "Data & AI",
  "location": "Cape Town",
  "effectiveDate": "2026-10-01T08:30:00Z"
}

### 10. Send a malformed payload by hand
POST {{integration}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "eventId": "EVT-BROKEN-002", "employeeId":

### 11. Break Employee 360: the next 2 requests return 500 (modes: error500, unavailable503, badrequest400, timeout)
POST {{mock}}/admin/faults
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "error500", "times": 2 }

### 12. Then publish the fault-demo event and watch the retries in the integration console
POST {{integration}}/samples/publish/11-fault-demo.json

### 13. Reset the mock API (clears stats and pending faults)
POST {{mock}}/admin/reset
